;; Simon's crypt, below the dungeon (campaign only, docs/HEROES.md): a high gothic room. The
;; player drops in from the dungeon's hole onto the landing at the top left, and a stair of
;; castle stone leads down to the floor, where captive Simon kneels under the spell (11,11)
;; beneath the stained glass, candles either side. The dark doorway in the right wall (rows
;; 10-11) leads back up into 5-4, dropping in at column 99, past the lift shaft, with the clock
;; running on. Column 16 is the doorway's back wall, just off the locked screen.

